                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Love this game, a different take on platformer kind of gaming. Plenty of levels to puzzle through, I like playing it with the keyboard when solo and then on controllers when playing with others. Definately shines when playing with others, able to discuss how to beat a level together.\n\nYou don't have to restart levels if a character dies, they just respawn in the last safe place, which is nice to have on the longer levels else it'd be mental to work through them deathless.\n\nExcellent music too!",
